' v1.2's `/petko` (`MapScene.OnKeyPress`, `ShowCheatDialog`,
' `OnDialogHidden`), typed on the map in an ordinary game: run with `preset
' classic ai amiga seed 7 health 40 savefile <f>` (the human at Stove Vent,
' prepared wounded so that Refill shows). Each answer, the statistics' line
' and a save; `v12_petko_resume` loads it. Add `piles` to see Items' pile.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
press h                  ' statistics, before: no cheats line
snap petko_stats_clean
press escape
type /p
press e                  ' while typing, a bound key is the command's: no pack
type et
press escape             ' Escape drops what is typed: no menu either
type ko                  ' not the word any more: nothing
type /petko              ' the dialog
snap petko_dialog
talkline 1               ' Refill: food 9, water 5, health 100
type /petko
talkline 2               ' Items: [debug] insert_items_1..3 at Stove Vent's entry
mapclick 354,317         ' in, where they lie
wait 30
esc                      ' out to the map
wait 10
type /petko
press escape             ' Back: nothing chosen
type /petko
talkline 0               ' Travel: the fast-travel cursor
snap petko_travel
mapclick 75,303          ' New Sandez, no road and no day: there, and in
wait 30
esc
wait 10
press h                  ' statistics: "- Cheats active -"
snap petko_stats
press escape
day
save
